{"publicId":"77f1b0f7-ab76-47af-8109-a66f5119c151","title":"DESI首次精确测定银河系质量及暗物质占比","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:00:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T12:00:01.000Z","digest":"DESI通过追踪银河系内天体运动，首次在可见物质之外明确量化了暗物质占比（约27%），修正了现有宇宙学模型。该成果基于对超过100万颗恒星和星系团的速度与距离关系分析，早前研究存在银河系暗物质比例从15%到35%的争议（2023-08-12 Phys.org报道）。目前DESI项目组尚未公布具体样本量、观测时间范围及误差范围，后续将结合其他观测数据验证结论。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T13:14:31.218Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"DESI 首次精确测定银河系质量","latestReport":{"id":"q8b3ugzwbikul7vea739698b6"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fE-_e71tMDak","title":"DESI weighs the Milky Way more precisely than ever","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:00:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"q8b3ugzwbikul7vea739698b6","title":"DESI 首次精确测定银河系质量","summary":"该研究利用 DESI 仪器追踪银河系内天体运动，首次在可见物质之外明确量化了银河系暗物质占比，为宇宙学模型提供了关键修正依据。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:00:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"q8b3ugzwbikul7vea739698b6","title":"DESI 首次精确测定银河系质量","summary":"该研究利用 DESI 仪器追踪银河系内天体运动，首次在可见物质之外明确量化了银河系暗物质占比，为宇宙学模型提供了关键修正依据。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:00:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z","heat